    "description": "Family of instruments designated the CI-600 Series, utilising the CI-601A or CI-605A digital indicating devices connected to a weighing platform to form a single or dual-interval, Class III or IIII, non-automatic weighing instrument. Main features: plastic enclosure, 4.3\" LCD display, operator keypad with numerical, navigation and function keys, Relay In/Out option card (CI-605A), Analogue Out option card (CI-601A, CI-605A). Devices: initial zero setting device on power up, semi-automatic zero setting, zero tracking (optional), semi-automatic subtractive tare weighing, preset tare, gross/net indication, zero-indicator, indication of stable equilibrium, net indicator, gravity compensation, hold function, soft function keys (F1, F2, F3), memory storage. Interfaces: load cell connection, RS232/485, Relay In/Out (CI-605A), Analogue Out (CI-601A, CI-605A). Software is held in firmware with identification number V1.xx; access to setup/configuration mode is only allowed via a jumper located on the circuit board, sealed with a wire-and-seal solution. Not designed for direct sales to the public. Any compatible R60-certified load cell may be used subject to compatibility of modules."
